                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 180.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Translation of telegram in Novoe Vremia of October
                        26/November 7, 1895.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram dated. Vladivostok, October 25/November
                        6, 1895.]</seg></opener>
                <p>The transport <hi rendition="#italic">Yatka</hi>, protecting marine industry in
                    the Sea of Okhotsk, seized seventeen foreign poaching vessels at the Island of
                    Seals, with a freight of killed seal bears. The poachers were landed on the
                    island. One of the poaching schooners made its escape.</p>
            </div>
